{"id": "68294", "title": "预谋出轨", "author": "林笛儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68294.htm", "intro": "她借着酒意敲开了他的门，他眯起眼，邪魅地歪歪嘴角：干吗？\r\n  她脑中闪过一张冷峻漠然的面孔，她甩甩头，手搭上他的肩，装疯卖傻地笑道：陪你呀！\r\n  当真？\r\n  比真理还真。\r\n  他盯了她两秒，弯下腰，嘴角擦过她的脸颊：再说一遍。\r\n  只做不说。她晕眩地将手伸向他的腰带。\r\n  结婚时，她知道他心里面有一个人。\r\n  不过有情人总难成眷属，他和那个人是不可能在一起的。\r\n  朋友说，人都是你的了，你还有什么不放心的？\r\n  后来，那个人回来了。\r\n  后来，她遇到了一个有着一对桃花眼的男人。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68294", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10524422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10524423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10524424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10524425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10524426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10524427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10524428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10524429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10524430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10524431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10524432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-61", "file": "10524433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "62-65", "file": "10524434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-69", "file": "10524435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-74", "file": "10524436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-80", "file": "10524437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10524438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-91", "file": "10524439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "92-93", "file": "10524440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "以下接书版第二十三章", "file": "10524441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-27", "file": "10524442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28", "file": "10524443.html", "available": false}]}